<title>USA: Systems Comms gets insurer contract.</title>
<headline>Systems Comms gets insurer contract.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Management Technologies Inc, a unit of Systems Communications Inc, said on Friday it has agreed to provide Mutual of Omaha its newest product release, HMT's Return for Managed Care Software.</p>
<p>Health Management said it develops and markets software products and services for managing cases of workers' disability that facilitate return to work and reduce overall health cost.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to place a dollar amount on the deal.</p>
</text>
